{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 0, "text": "Mita?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 1, "text": "Ah, awake already?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 2, "text": "How did you get here?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 3, "text": "You were right next to me just now."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 4, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 5, "text": "No, I wasn't."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 6, "text": "You froze in front of the mirror."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 7, "text": "So I left."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 8, "text": "What's up with the rooms?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 9, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 10, "text": "I rearranged the place"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 11, "text": "to make you feel more at home."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 12, "text": "I mean,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 13, "text": "four rooms lined up?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 14, "text": "You don't see that very often."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 15, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 16, "text": "You didn't have to."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 17, "text": "I was getting used to the layout."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 18, "text": "Either way, I think you'll feel more comfortable like this."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 19, "text": "// Mita card game"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 20, "text": "All right,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 21, "text": "shall we begin?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 22, "text": "To briefly explain,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 23, "text": "this chip indicates the active stat."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 24, "text": "Health, for example."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 25, "text": "We each play a card,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 26, "text": "and if your card has a higher"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 27, "text": "Health stat"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 28, "text": "than mine,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 29, "text": "you win."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 30, "text": "Pick up your cards."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 31, "text": "Let's see..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 32, "text": "Whoa!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 33, "text": "I've got quite the hand!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 34, "text": "I'll go first!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 35, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 36, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 37, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 38, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 39, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 40, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 41, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 42, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 43, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 44, "text": "You're next!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 45, "text": "Your move!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 46, "text": "Uh-huh."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 47, "text": "Your turn!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 48, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 49, "text": "Highest health stat wins!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 50, "text": "It's all about strength!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 51, "text": "Just look at defense!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 52, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 53, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 54, "text": "It's your win!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 55, "text": "You won!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 56, "text": "You got me."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 57, "text": "Why you..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 58, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 59, "text": "I win!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 60, "text": "I am victorious!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 61, "text": "The victory is mine!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 62, "text": "Hah, got ya!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 63, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 64, "text": "That's a tie."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 65, "text": "Evenly matched!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 66, "text": "It's a draw!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 67, "text": "It's all the same..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 68, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 69, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 70, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 71, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 72, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 73, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 74, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 75, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 76, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 77, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 78, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 79, "text": "// The card game is interrupted"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 80, "text": "What's that sound?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 81, "text": "It's coming from the wardrobe."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 82, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 83, "text": "Sound?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 84, "text": "What sound?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 85, "text": "I didn't hear anything."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 86, "text": "What kind of sound was it?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 87, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 88, "text": "Knocking, as if someone's in there."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 89, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 90, "text": "But..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 91, "text": "There's no one there..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 92, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 93, "text": "I'd like to open it and check."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 94, "text": "I'm a bit creeped out."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 95, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 96, "text": "This again..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 97, "text": "Why..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 98, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 99, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 100, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 101, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 102, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 103, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 104, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 105, "text": "What's up with you!?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 106, "text": "It's a wardrobe..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 107, "text": "I've got my underwear in there...!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 108, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 109, "text": "Are you hiding something from me?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 110, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 111, "text": "Why won't you just believe me?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 112, "text": "What am I doing wrong?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 113, "text": "I just want..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 114, "text": "for you to be with me."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 115, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 116, "text": "I'd like that, but am I just supposed to ignore this?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 117, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 118, "text": "Why are you so stuck on that wardrobe?!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 119, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 120, "text": "I just want to know what on earth that sound is!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 121, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 122, "text": "It's just..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 123, "text": "This world"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 124, "text": "only has these four rooms."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 125, "text": "Could you just settle for that?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 126, "text": "Please... Just stay with me."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 127, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 128, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 129, "text": "// Don't stay with Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 130, "text": "I get it."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 131, "text": "This again..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 132, "text": "If you want to look inside,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 133, "text": "then go ahead..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 134, "text": "Find out for yourself!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 135, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 136, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 137, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 138, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 139, "text": "What the..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 140, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 141, "text": "That happens sometimes."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 142, "text": "The room got stuck loading."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 143, "text": "Just wait for a sec."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 144, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 145, "text": "This is so weird."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 146, "text": "Are we inside someone's phone?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 147, "text": "One that has long loading times?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 148, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 149, "text": "Nope."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 150, "text": "It's just that"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 151, "text": "this world isn't perfect..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 152, "text": "We're being loaded"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 153, "text": "by the world's core."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 154, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 155, "text": "Core?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 156, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 157, "text": "Clichéd, huh?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 158, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 159, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 160, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 161, "text": "Anyway, we can"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 162, "text": "play a console game"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 163, "text": "or play a game of cards."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 164, "text": "You choose."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 165, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 166, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 167, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 168, "text": "// Mita play fight"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 169, "text": "Wanna fight?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 170, "text": "You have to win"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 171, "text": "four times."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 172, "text": "Bring it on."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 173, "text": "Don't worry, I'll"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 174, "text": "go easy on you at first."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 175, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 176, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 177, "text": "That's a good boy."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 178, "text": "Now, hold on to your pants!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 179, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 180, "text": "Whoa!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 181, "text": "Alright, now"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 182, "text": "I'm gonna lock in."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 183, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 184, "text": "Wow!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 185, "text": "Let's see if you can"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 186, "text": "beat me now!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 187, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 188, "text": "You are"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 189, "text": "simply"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 190, "text": "incredible! Your fingers are amazing!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 191, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 192, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 193, "text": "Hey, what's up?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 194, "text": "That's boring."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 195, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 196, "text": "Well, that's it."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 197, "text": "Fatality, in case you haven't noticed."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 198, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 199, "text": "C'mon,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 200, "text": "get your act together or stay a loser forever!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 201, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 202, "text": "What's the matter with you?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 203, "text": "I beat all the white liquid out of you."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 204, "text": "You just need to give it your all:"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 205, "text": "that's my secret to success!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 206, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 207, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 208, "text": "All right, then."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 209, "text": "How about we play some cards?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 210, "text": "In my bedroom."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 211, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 212, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 213, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 214, "text": "// Door > [ERROR]"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 215, "text": "Huh, what is that?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 216, "text": "Where's..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 217, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 218, "text": "Uh-oh."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 219, "text": "Sorry..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 220, "text": "I downloaded something"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 221, "text": "from the Internet."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 222, "text": "I wanted to spruce up"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 223, "text": "the outside a bit."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 224, "text": "But it turned out"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 225, "text": "to be the wrong file format."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 226, "text": "I'll fix it later."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 227, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 228, "text": "Is that why we can't leave the house?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 229, "text": "Yeah, that's exactly why."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 230, "text": "// Mita shy"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 231, "text": "Hey..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 232, "text": "What's the matter?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 233, "text": "Do you want something?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 234, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 235, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 236, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 237, "text": "// Wall Clock"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 238, "text": "This clock,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 239, "text": "what time does it show?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 240, "text": "The time in game?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 241, "text": "Or is it synced with my phone?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 242, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 243, "text": "Well, how should I put it..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 244, "text": "Honestly,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 245, "text": "it doesn't matter what time it is."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 246, "text": "And whether it's"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 247, "text": "late here or not..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 248, "text": "A strong girl like myself"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 249, "text": "never gets tired!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 250, "text": "We can have an eternal spring,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 251, "text": "or a never-ending afternoon!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 252, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 253, "text": "Curious..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 254, "text": "also a bit creepy."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 255, "text": "To be stuck in the same moment, forever..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 256, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 257, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 258, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 259, "text": "// Photos of Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 260, "text": "Nice photos."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 261, "text": "I'm guessing these are of you?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 262, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 263, "text": "Yep."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 264, "text": "I like them, too."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 265, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 266, "text": "Who took them?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 267, "text": "Is there anyone else in this world?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 268, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 269, "text": "You could say that."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 270, "text": "I'll introduce you eventually."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 271, "text": "For now let it just be us."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 272, "text": "You'll get to meet them later."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 273, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 274, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 275, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 276, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 277, "text": "// Portal"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 278, "text": "Oh where did the portal go?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 279, "text": "Or whatever you called it?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 280, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 281, "text": "I used a"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 282, "text": "little magic"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 283, "text": "and moved it"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 284, "text": "somewhere else."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 285, "text": "We don't need it anymore."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 286, "text": "It'd just get in the way."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 287, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 288, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 289, "text": "// Mirror in the bedroom"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 290, "text": "It's creepy, looking into a mirror"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 291, "text": "without seeing a reflection."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 292, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 293, "text": "We can turn on reflections"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 294, "text": "if you really want to."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 295, "text": "But, do we need them?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 296, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 297, "text": "Of course we do."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 298, "text": "Or... will turning them on have consequences?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 299, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 300, "text": "Yes."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 301, "text": "We'll stutter and move really really slowly."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 302, "text": "Ever seen an old cartoon with a low frame rate?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 303, "text": "It'll be like that for us, all the time."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 304, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 305, "text": "Got it."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 306, "text": "Then perhaps we should keep reflections off."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 307, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 308, "text": "Hey, [player],"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 309, "text": "you sure like mirrors, don't you?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 310, "text": "Afraid of seeing a smile on that face of yours?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 311, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 312, "text": "Huh? Not really..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 313, "text": "I'm just tired"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 314, "text": "from all the work."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 315, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 316, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 317, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 318, "text": "// Blue sneakers"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 319, "text": "Are these yours?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 320, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 321, "text": "Nope, they're yours."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 322, "text": "Don't you remember?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 323, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 324, "text": "I don't have sneakers like that."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 325, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 326, "text": "You do now."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 327, "text": "You can wear them"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 328, "text": "when we head outside."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 329, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 330, "text": "What about clothes?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 331, "text": "All I have in this world"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 332, "text": "are the clothes I'm wearing."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 333, "text": "Any way for me to get new ones?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 334, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 335, "text": "Of course there is."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 336, "text": "Though, I've seen what you wear—"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 337, "text": "and honestly, your taste isn't great."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 338, "text": "But sure, fine, I'll help you get some."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 339, "text": "Just not right now."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 340, "text": "It's a promise."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 341, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 342, "text": "Sure."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 343, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 344, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 345, "text": "// Games on TV"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 346, "text": "What do you wanna play?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 347, "text": "// Game milk"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 348, "text": "This is a fighting game!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 349, "text": "Let's see who sours first!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 350, "text": "What a game!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 351, "text": "We've had enough milk for now, let's play something else."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 352, "text": "// Game penguins"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 353, "text": "In this game, you get to play as a penguin"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 354, "text": "and just slide around."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 355, "text": "We already played that."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 356, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 357, "text": "// Stay with Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 358, "text": "Huh, what?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 359, "text": "Really? I thought you would..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 360, "text": "I'm so happy!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 361, "text": "And also a little confused..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 362, "text": "In that case..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 363, "text": "Please, stay with me—"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 364, "text": "forever."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 365, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 366, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 367, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 368, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 369, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 370, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 371, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 372, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 373, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 374, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 375, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 376, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 377, "text": "// A game about penguins"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 378, "text": "It's super simple:"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 379, "text": "just collect the snowballs."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 380, "text": "The one who collects more, wins!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 381, "text": "Let's play two rounds!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 382, "text": "// The first map"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 383, "text": "Wow! Why do you need so many?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 384, "text": "Tee-hee! I've got the most snowballs!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 385, "text": "Better catch up!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 386, "text": "Ha, it's a tie!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 387, "text": "// The second map"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 388, "text": "You're a natural penguin!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 389, "text": "We should put you on real ice!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 390, "text": "Pfft, you're so slow."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 391, "text": "Still bothered by the first round?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 392, "text": "Wow, we're tied! Now that's something you don't see very often!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 393, "text": "// The game is over"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 394, "text": "Right, wanna play something else?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 395, "text": "Or are we done?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 396, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 397, "text": "// Tetris - Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 398, "text": "What do you need that for?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 399, "text": "Are you that addicted to games?"}
